    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Hosted by African Population Health Research Centre (APHRC), the lead for the Health Policy and Research Organisation (HPRO), the Women RISE project, established under the Canadian  International Development Research Centre  (IDRC), the Canadian Institutes of Health Research (CIHR) and the Social Sciences and Humanities Research Council (SSHRC) held their inception meeting in Nairobi, Kenya from the 24 th  to the 26 th  of January 2023.",
